      <p source="#source-714-908"><seg source="#source-714-744">私儀此頃甚多端、別紙</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-750-801"><seg source="#source-744-750">福田</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-774-786">（扇馬）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-801-831">氏より申上候、御聞取</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-831-900"><rb><seg source="#source-834-837">可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-837-849">レ</note><seg source="#source-849-852">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-852-864">レ</note><seg source="#source-864-867">遣</seg></rb><rt>（つかはさるべく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-900-908">候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-908-1093"><seg source="#source-908-929">○長久丸ニハ土</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-935-995"><seg source="#source-929-935">商会</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-959-980">○近日出帆の時</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-995-1061">の者壱人さしそへ御在番役所まで御引合仕候と奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1061-1073">レ</note><seg source="#source-1073-1093">存候。百拝。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1093-1152" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1114-1152"><seg source="#source-1114-1129">五月十七日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1129-1152" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1147-1152">龍</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
